{'symbol': 'USB', 'date': '2022-12-19 11:27:00', 'title': 'U.S. BANCORP CLASS ACTION: LEVI & KORSINSKY REMINDS U.S. BANCORP INVESTORS OF THE PENDING CLASS ACTION LAWSUIT WITH A LEAD PLAINTIFF DEADLINE OF DECEMBER 27, 2022 - USB', 'text': 'NEW YORK, NEW YORK--(NEWSFILE CORP. - DECEMBER 19, 2022) - LEVI & KORSINSKY, LLP NOTIFIES INVESTORS IN U.S. BANCORP ("U.S. BANCORP" OR THE "COMPANY") (NYSE: USB) OF A CLASS ACTION SECURITIES LAWSUIT.THE LAWSUIT ON BEHALF OF U.S. BANCORP INVESTORS HAS BEEN COMMENCED IN THE THE UNITED STATES DISTRICT COURT FOR THE SOUTHERN DISTRICT OF NEW YORK. AFFECTED INVESTORS PURCHASED OR OTHERWISE ACQUIRED CERTAIN U.S. BANCORP SECURITIES BETWEEN AUGUST 1, 2019 AND JULY 28, 2022.'}{'symbol': 'USB', 'date': '2022-12-19 05:45:00', 'title': 'CLASS ACTION ALERT: THE LAW OFFICES OF VINCENT WONG REMIND U.S. BANCORP INVESTORS OF A LEAD PLAINTIFF DEADLINE OF DECEMBER 27, 2022', 'text': 'NEW YORK , DEC. 19, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- ATTENTION U.S. BANCORP ("U.S. BANCORP") (NYSE: USB) SHAREHOLDERS: THE LAW OFFICES OF VINCENT WONG ANNOUNCE THAT A CLASS ACTION LAWSUIT HAS COMMENCED ON BEHALF OF INVESTORS WHO PURCHASED BETWEEN AUGUST 1, 2019 AND JULY 28, 2022. IF YOU SUFFERED A LOSS ON YOUR INVESTMENT IN U.S. BANCORP, CONTACT US ABOUT POTENTIAL RECOVERY BY USING THE LINK BELOW.'}{'symbol': 'USB', 'date': '2022-12-17 13:30:00', 'title': 'SHAREHOLDER ALERT: POMERANTZ LAW FIRM INVESTIGATES CLAIMS ON BEHALF OF INVESTORS U.S. BANCORP - USB', 'text': 'NEW YORK, NEW YORK--(NEWSFILE CORP. - DECEMBER 17, 2022) - POMERANTZ LLP IS INVESTIGATING CLAIMS ON BEHALF OF INVESTORS OF U.S. BANCORP ("U.S. BANCORP" OR THE "COMPANY") (NYSE: USB). SUCH INVESTORS ARE ADVISED TO CONTACT ROBERT S. WILLOUGHBY AT NEWACTION@POMLAW.COM OR 888-476-6529, EXT. 7980.THE INVESTIGATION CONCERNS WHETHER U.S. BANCORP AND CERTAIN OF ITS OFFICERS AND/OR DIRECTORS HAVE ENGAGED IN SECURITIES FRAUD OR OTHER UNLAWFUL BUSINESS PRACTICES.'}